### Get all check-ins

GET http://localhost:8080/api/checkin
Accept: application/json

### Get check-ins by User ID

GET http://localhost:8080/api/checkin/{{testMemberId}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a check-in
POST http://localhost:8080/api/checkin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{$uuid}}",
  "memberId": "{{testMemberId}}",
  "staffMemberId": "{{testAdminId}}",
  "method": "MANUAL"
}